WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:11,640
If I want, I will die and save some strength.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,840
Wouldn't it be better to follow him on the way to Huangquan?

3
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:30,200
Tell me something useful. I have help, boss. I have information.

4
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,000
In addition to the two of us, there are three other members in our team

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
The location cards and stealth cards were all put together by the team.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,120
It's them who are covering your green-haired suit and want to kill and intercept you.

7
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:39,010
Who are the other three people crazy?

8
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,530
Storm Dragon King and Poison Shot Acacia Bureau

9
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:41,730
They are all waiting for Brother Meng to kill you

10
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,970
Finished talking about scraping supplies.
